Qa09Wm2rJTitDs-mGkWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3KVJ3KI1T4OVJ7U-ZhH4lvaor9IS3W8WIygTzPd5X2KA&oe=69D3BF57"}, "display_name": "Tarot", "keywords": ["roguelite", "roguelike", "shooter", "action", "survival"], "long_description": "**Your Fate Isn\u2019t Written - It\u2019s Fought...**\n\nTarot is an action-packed VR roguelite in which you battle against hordes of creatures and demons using special Tarot cards. Each card gives a unique weapon and powerful discard ability, enabling you to increase your chances of survival by levelling up and combining cards for the ultimate beast-slaying build. Spend points earned to grow stronger for each new run and discover hidden secrets hidden throughout each stage to unlock new special cards, new lore and a hidden journey into the abyss...", "short_description": "Tarot is an action-packed VR roguelite in which you battle against hordes of creatures and demons using special Tarot cards. Each card gives a unique weapon and powerful discard ability, enabling you to increase your chances of survival by levelling up and combining cards for the ultimate beast-slaying build. Can you discover all the secrets and journey into the abyss for the ultimate battle?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://moonshinedgames.com/#privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Moonshined Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://moonshinedgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": n